Z||000010||Patrick||10-11-2000||02:59 AM||||<BR>A young man walks into a drug store to buy condoms. The pharmacist tells the young fella that the condoms come in packs of 3, 9 or 12 and asks him which size package he wants. "Well," the young man says, "I've been seeing this girl for a while and she's really hot. I want the condoms because I think tonight's going to be THE night. We're having dinner with her parents, and then we're going out. I've got a feeling I'm gonna get lucky after that. And once she's had me, she'll want me again and again, so you'd better give me the 12 pack." The young man makes his purchase and leaves.  <P>Later that evening, he sits down to dinner with his girlfriend and her parents. He asks if he might give the blessing, and they agree. He begins the prayer, but continues praying with his head bowed for several minutes even after everyone else starts eating. His girlfriend leans over and says, "You never told me you were such a religious person." He leans over to her and whispers, "You never told me your father was a pharmacist."<P>******<P>Yeah, I know, you were hoping for something crude. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||6
