Z||000013||Coconut||10-11-2000||07:26 PM||||A drop dead gorgeous woman walks into a bar and sits next to a not so bright mechanic. They engage in a little small talk and after a few minutes, she realizes that although she thinks this guy is hot, he's a little slow upstairs. Feeling amorous, she drops little hints here and there that she wants him to take her home but he still doesn't get it. Finally, she decides that hints won't do the trick and she has to be direct, so she tells him "Look...I've got an itchy p*#sy and I need you to fix it". The dummy  looks at her with this blank look on his face and says "I'd really like to help you but I don't know a thing about those Japanese cars". <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>(I apologize if this joke is a little too vulgar for some of our members and Cliff, if you feel that this post is inappropiate, please feel free to delete or edit as you see fit.)<P>Cruisin' On, <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Coconut's_Signature_1.JPG"> ||||reg||12
Z||000014||fropuff||10-11-2000||08:14 PM||||Q:Why did the blonde drive into the ditch?<BR>A:She wanted to shut her turn signal off.<P>Q:When does the blonde stop, go, stop, go?<BR>A:When she's driving through a flashing red signal light.  <P>Q:What do you call a guy with no arms or legs floating in a pool?<BR>A:Bob<P>Q:What do you call a guy with no arms or legs hanging on the wall?<BR>A:Art<P>Q:What do you call a guy with no arms or legs laying on the floor?<BR>A:Matt<P>Q:What do you call a Mexican girl with no legs?<BR>A:Cunswaylo.<BR>-You have to sound this one out.||||reg||1
