Z||000029||RiceCooker||10-14-2000||05:46 PM||||Three ropes sittin in a bar. The first rope gets up from their table, goes up to the bartender and says, "Can i get three beers please?" Bartender says, "no way, we don't serve ropes here." So the rope goes and sits down, disappointed.<BR>Second rope walks up to the bartender nonchalantly and says, "Yeah, i need three beers." The bartender yells back at him, " i told your friend, We don't serve ropes!!!"<P>So the third rope gets an idea. He throws himself down on the floor, twists himself all up, wiggles around, then rubs himself repeatedly against the end of the table. Well he looks like just a mess but he goes up and says, "Three beers please."<BR>The bartender asks, "aren't you a rope?"<BR>He replies, "Nope, I'm AFRAID NOT."<P><BR>||||reg||1
