Z||000031||olympic||10-15-2000||05:24 AM||||  A big brown bear walks up to a bar and orders a beer.  The bartender looks at him and says, sorry fella, we dont serve big brown bears in here.  The bear says "look, Mister, I just want one beer and I'll leave."  The bartender replies "I'm sorry but we just don't serve big brown bears in the bar."  The bear is getting mad now so he says " If you don't give me a beer right now I'm going to eat that woman sitting at the end of the bar!!"  Once again the bartender refuses so the bear storms to the end of the bar and devours the woman whole.<P>  He returns to the bartender and says "Are you happy now??  Are you going to serve me or do I have to eat someone else??"  The bartender shakes his head and says "Sorry, pal, we don't serve big brown bears in the bar, especially ones that are on drugs!"  The bear shouts "What do you mean, I'm not on drugs!!"  The bartender replies "Sure you are, that was just a BAR-B*TCH -U-ATE !!"    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by olympic (edited 10-15-2000).]||||reg||1
